    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Contains algorithms to handle the different battle attacks, skills and items. The algorithms support single targets and party targets. For party targets the caller is responsible for retargeting using TargetNext.</para>
<para>The action is simulated using Execute and the results can be applied after the simulation by calling Apply. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
